      {
        "id": "body-7",
        "kind": "body",
        "bbox_xywh": [
          125,
          1143,
          983,
          387
        ],
        "geometry_estimated": true,
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "body-7-line-01",
            "text": "Зновѹ Киноѱъ подлетѣв'ши горѣ еще вышше третїй раз",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1143,
              983,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 50
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-7-line-02",
            "text": "аж под ѡблаки спѹстив'ши ся погрѹзил ся оу море, сплескавъ",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1178,
              983,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 58
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-7-line-03",
            "text": "трыйчѣ рѹками своими. А ст҃ыи Іѡан оупав'ши на колѣна свои,",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1213,
              983,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 59
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-7-line-04",
            "text": "и в'сѣ люде вѣр'ные из Іѡаном, помолив'ши ся Бг҃ѹ нбс҃номѹ, и",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1248,
              983,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 61
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-7-line-05",
            "text": "так сила Бж҃їа погрѹзила Киноѱа оу безднѹ аж до преисподней",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1283,
              983,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 59
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-7-line-06",
            "text": "стороны. И так Киноѱъ пропавъ со шѹмом. А ст҃ыи Іѡан перед",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1318,
              983,
              36
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 58
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-7-line-07",
            "text": "всѣми людми сотворив мл҃твѹ, а того воеводѹ из дитиною пе-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1354,
              983,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 58
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-7-line-08",
            "text": "рекрестил крст҃омъ ст҃ымъ, а той воевода, то е҃ дїаволъ, ищезъ,",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1389,
              983,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 63
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-7-line-09",
            "text": "а з дѣтины стала цигла. Потом пережегнавъ того старого мѹжа",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1424,
              983,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 59
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-7-line-10",
            "text": "и женѹ со сн҃омъ, котрого то был Киноѱъ из моря вынѣсъ;",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1459,
              983,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 55
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-7-line-11",
            "text": "зараз дїаволы пропали, а сн҃ъ каменем сталъ.",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1494,
              983,
              36
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 44
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "body-8",
        "kind": "body",
        "bbox_xywh": [
          125,
          1534,
          983,
          67
        ],
        "geometry_estimated": true,
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "body-8-line-01",
            "text": "Рек ст҃ыи Іѡан до невѣрных людїй: „Видите, ѡкаянныи,",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1534,
              983,
              33
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 52
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-8-line-02",
            "text": "матацство проклятого Бг҃а вш҃его“. И так едны Ефесане тогдый",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              125,
              1567,
              983,
              34
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00159-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 60
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
